    "title": "Teen dies after being pulled from pond at Freedom Park in Star - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By CBS2 News Staff ,\n4 hours ago STAR, Idaho (CBS2) — A teenage boy died Wednesday afternoon after being pulled from a pond at Freedom Park in Star, authorities said. Star Police deputies were dispatched at about 3:30 p.m. on March 18 to a reported water rescue and drowning at the park. Boise Fire later recovered the teenager from the pond. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 9",
